.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-release-previous 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-release\-previous \- Print the nearest ancestor release tag before a release tag, under a glob; exit 2 when the tag is not a release under it
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten release previous\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fB\-\-tag\fR> <\fB\-\-pattern\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the nearest ancestor release tag before a release tag, under a glob; exit 2 when the tag is not a release under it
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI<tag>\fR
The release tag whose nearest ancestor release is printed
.TP
\fB\-\-pattern\fR \fI<pattern>\fR
The glob a release tag matches; its literal prefix is stripped once, then the version is parsed as semver
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
